g as a financial information assistant and include cautionary notes to rely on official sources and multiple information sources.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"No persistence, background workers, privilege escalation, tool wrapping, memory writes, or cross-session behavior are present in the artifact.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The stated purpose is to search, summarize, and interpret financial news, policy, market summaries, company announcements, and global market links; the listed capabilities match that purpose.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Before installing, understand that this skill is for informational market-news summaries and subjective financial interpretation, not investment advice. Verify important claims against official sources and request another response language if Chinese is not preferred.","findings":"[SQP-3] expected: The artifact is entirely in Chinese, which is consistent with a Chinese-language finance news assistant and does not create a security concern; users who prefer another language may need to ask explicitly.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789180556143}}}}}